# Mutation plan for the 2026-09-07 gated-families group — fourteen routes.
#
#   scripts/mutate-batch.sh scripts/mutations/gated-families.plan
#
# Four families, four refusals, **two** statuses, and one gate with two arms that share a status
# and differ only in id. Half this plan swaps one family's id or status for a neighbour's, because
# that is the mistake four look-alike families invite. The rest is the two configuration gates,
# whose *enabled* side is only reachable through a second server, and compliance's three
# permissions across four routes.
#
# The last two lines are the no-op controls and must SURVIVE.
